{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Patchset 2 / Gerrit 1782 review and CI remediation (72730d3911d2a5b49ea80458b9dad2cbf6796616):\n\nLLM-Review +1 carried four advisory findings. Two were valid and actionable: (1) the workflow-consumed classifier CLI boundary lacked a subprocess test; added test_classifier_cli_prints_the_workflow_route_contract. (2) the composite action selector shell lacked an executable selection test; added a temp-Git-repository test that executes the real action script and proves unit and unmarked integration documentation modules remain selected while external, conftest, and non-doc modules do not. Two findings were intentionally not changed: all full-route jobs must await trusted classification or a docs-only change would consume the full runner graph, contrary to this ticket and the no-extra-runner-use constraint; classifier failure must still block Verified even when the full fallback graph passes, because otherwise an unverified/invalid route decision could vote green.\n\nIndependent background audit found tests/integration/test_init_fail_closed.py is unmarked and its CLI-help/generated-reference contract runs in default Verify, but the first selector excluded the directory. RED structural oracle reproduced the omission; the action now excludes tiers solely with pytest markers. The real selector collects the missed test. Full reduced subset: 2,459 passed, 15 skipped in 97.30s.\n\nPatchset-1 CI_RESULT: run 31822847110 failed after 1,755s; all four OS/Python lanes failed only the stale test_gerrit_verify_triage_comment vote-needs assertion, which omitted classify and docs-only. Updated that pinned contract and renamed it to describe route coverage. Focused workflow/classifier suite: 212 passed. make lint/actionlint and the commit hook with the worktree venv passed. Patchset 2 pushed without waiting for an idle CI window."},"env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786729342292510001,"uuid":"2693a33a-4209-42f0-8d63-0cd3d267dc32"}